{"ref":"weapon:celestial-dusting","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Celestial Dusting is a weapon from the base game version of Vampire Survivors that was introduced in Patch 0.5.1. It is the starting weapon of ",{"i":"Sprite-O'Sole_Meeo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," ",{"t":"O'Sole Meeo","r":"character:o-sole-meeo"},". Other characters have a small chance to obtain it after O'Sole Meeo is unlocked. It can also be obtained from ",{"i":"Sprite-Merchant.png","w":23,"h":24}," Merchant in-game by spending ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,000, or by selecting this weapon from ",{"i":"Sprite-Candybox.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:candybox"}," ",{"t":"Candybox","r":"weapon:candybox"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Its evolution is ",{"i":"Sprite-Profusione_D'Amore.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:profusione-d-amore"}," ",{"t":"Profusione D'Amore","r":"weapon:profusione-d-amore"},", which requires ",{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Altemanna.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Altemanna","r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}," and reaching level 80 while playing as O'Sole Meeo."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Weapon","rows":[{"label":"ID","hint":"Weapon's name in game files.","cells":[["FLOWER"]]},{"label":"Type","cells":[["Normal"]]},{"label":"Evolution","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Profusione_D'Amore.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"weapon:profusione-d-amore"}," ",{"t":"Profusione D'Amore","r":"weapon:profusione-d-amore"}]]},{"label":"Evolved with","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Chaos_Altemanna.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}," ",{"t":"Chaos Altemanna","r":"relic:chaos-altemanna"}]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["8"]]},{"label":"Rarity","hint":"Weapon's weight in the pool of available weapons.","cells":[["1"]]},{"label":"Effects","cells":[["Ignores ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},". Generate little heart at max level. Scales with ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," when moving."]]}]},{"title":"Stats","rows":[{"label":"Damage","hint":"Damage number randomization in ±5 range is only a visual effect. Actual damage dealt is always the same.","cells":[["5"],["10 (+5)"]]},{"label":"Area","cells":[["100%"],[]]},{"label":"Speed","hint":"Weapon's projectile speed.","cells":[["70%"],["160% (+90%)"]]},{"label":"Amount","hint":"Amount of projectiles/areas fired per use.","cells":[["1"],["2 (+1)"]]},{"label":"Duration","cells":[["0.5 s"],["1.5 s (+1)"]]},{"label":"Pierce","hint":"Maximum amount of enemies that a projectile can hit.","cells":[["Area of Effect"],[]]},{"label":"Cooldown","cells":[["6.0 s"],[]]},{"label":"Projectile Interval","cells":[["0.1 s"],[]]},{"label":"Hitbox Delay","hint":"Time before the same enemy can be hit again.","cells":[["0.3 s"],[]]},{"label":"Knockback","cells":[["0.1"],[]]},{"label":"Pool Limit","hint":"Maximum amount of active projectiles.","cells":[["100"],[]]},{"label":"Blocked by walls","cells":[["Yes"],[]]}],"cols":["Normal","Max"]}],"sections":[{"id":"effects","title":"Effects","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Celestial Dusting fires flowers away from the player character's walking direction that bounce off of walls and obstacles, but pierce through an unlimited number of enemies. As they reach the end of their ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", they slow down and shed petals in a small X shape, dealing additional damage to nearby enemies."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," increases its overall spawn rate when moving, when the character stops it initiates the default ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},". Celestial Dusting ignores ",{"i":"Sprite-Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:speed"}," ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," bonuses outside of its level ups."]},{"k":"p","c":["Celestial Dusting has a 0.3 second Hitbox Delay, meaning that the same enemy cannot be hit more often than every 0.3 seconds by the same flower. However, because all active delays are reset simultaneously as soon as any one elapses, some enemies may get hit more often."]},{"k":"p","c":["At max level, Celestial Dusting gains a 66% chance to generate a ",{"i":"Sprite-Little_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24}," Little Heart when an enemy is defeated. This chance is unaffected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Luck.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:luck"}," ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["In ",{"t":"Il Molise","r":"stage:il-molise"}," in particular, the Celestial Dusting provides additional health to Molisanos, instead of damaging them."]}],"subs":[{"id":"effects-arcanas","title":"Arcanas","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sarabande_of_Healing_(VI).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," ",{"t":"Sarabande of Healing (VI)","r":"weapon:sarabande-of-healing-vi"}," - Allows Celestial Dusting's Little Hearts to heal 2 points of health and trigger a pulse dealing the same amount of damage."]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Twilight_Requiem_(II).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"}," ",{"t":"Twilight Requiem (II)","r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"}," - Allows the flowers to explode when they expire. The explosions also have the same chance to generate Little Hearts. Damage is based on ",{"i":"Sprite-Curse.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:curse"}," ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},"."]}]}]}]},{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Celestial Dusting has 8 levels. At max level, Celestial Dusting has +5 Base Damage, +90% ",{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"},", +1 to ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},", +1.0 seconds to ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},", and has a chance to generate Little Hearts when enemies are defeated."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["Throws a bouncing projectile. Cooldown reduces when moving."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Effect lasts 1 s longer."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Base Speed up by 30%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Base Damage up by 5."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Base Speed up by 30%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 6"]},{"c":["Fires 1 more projectile."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 7"]},{"c":["Base Speed up by 30%."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 8"]},{"c":["Defeated enemies might drop hearts."]}]}]}],"subs":[{"id":"levels-limit-break","title":"Limit Break","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["With Limit Break, Celestial Dusting can be further leveled up."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Description"],"h":1},{"c":["Rarity"],"h":1},{"c":["Max Total"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}," +0.5%[1]"]},{"c":["10"]},{"c":["-"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"}," +1%"]},{"c":["10"]},{"c":["500%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"t":"Speed","r":"powerup:speed"}," +5%"]},{"c":["10"]},{"c":["300%"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}," +100%[2]"]},{"c":["1"]},{"c":["3.0 s"]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," +1"]},{"c":["1"]},{"c":["20"]}]}]},{"k":"ol","items":[{"c":["Base Damage +0.5"]},{"c":[{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}," +100ms"]}]}]}]},{"id":"combos","title":"Combos","blocks":[{"k":"note","c":["See Combos for a list of all item interactions."]},{"k":"h","c":["Stats and passive items"]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Spinach.png","w":24,"h":24,"a":"A sprite icon representing Spinach linking to Spinach","r":"passive:spinach"}],"h":1},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"a":"A sprite icon representing Armor linking to Armor (item)","r":"passive:armor-item"}],"h":1},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"a":"A sprite icon representing Hollow Heart linking to Hollow Heart","r":"passive:hollow-heart"}],"h":1},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h