e between ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," and current Health"]},{"c":["With ",{"t":"Twilight Requiem (II)","r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"},", explosion damage is affected by ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"}]},{"c":["Affected by ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},", ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"},", and ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},". With ",{"t":"Divine Bloodline (IX)","r":"weapon:divine-bloodline-ix"},", damage is indirectly affected by the difference between ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," and current Health"]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to flat damage"]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}]},{"c":["With ",{"t":"Twilight Requiem (II)","r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"},", explosion damage is indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Curse","r":"powerup:curse"},". With ",{"t":"Sapphire Mist (I)","r":"arcana:sapphire-mist-i"},", extra activation chance is indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Luck","r":"powerup:luck"}]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"}]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"}]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"}," and ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"}]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to activation"]},{"c":["Indirectly affected by bonuses to stats"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Celestial Dusting fires rather quickly, so with some ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"}," bonuses, it can produce a constant stream of flowers behind you."]},{"c":["Like ",{"i":"Sprite-Hellfire.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hellfire"}," ",{"t":"Hellfire","r":"weapon:hellfire"},", Celestial Dusting benefits heavily from ",{"i":"Sprite-Area.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"powerup:area"}," ",{"t":"Area","r":"powerup:area"}," bonuses increasing the size of the vast amount of flowers."]},{"c":["By tapping direction keys rapidly, Celestial Dusting can shoot out flowers all around the character away from where the character is facing. If you have to stay still around a dense group of enemies, it can retain the faster fire rate from moving."]},{"c":["Uniquely, in ",{"t":"Il Molise","r":"stage:il-molise"},", the plant enemies in this stage are healed instead of damaged by Celestial Dusting's plants. The player will still gain some passive experience by healing the plants. Healing the plants for an extended amount of time will eventually unlock a ",{"t":"secret character","r":"character:peppino"},"."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Notably, the healing appears to add max health, instead of just regenerating missing ones. This means that Celestial Dusting can increase the health of the plants past their normal cap, and cause them to become effectively immortal."]},{"c":["The amount of health the plants get is dependent on the damage that would be typically dealt, divided by 5[Verify]."]},{"c":["When using ",{"i":"Sprite-Twilight_Requiem_(II).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"}," ",{"t":"Twilight Requiem (II)","r":"arcana:twilight-requiem-ii"},", the explosion from the flowers expiring also heals plants, as they inherit the property of the weapon, like they can generate ",{"i":"Sprite-Little_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24}," Little Heart if the explosion kills an enemy."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[],"subs":[{"id":"gallery-flower-sprites","title":"Flower sprites","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["There are 89 different flower sprites used 