rush\" being a synonym for \"dusting\"."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["One of the Celestial Brush techniques is ",{"t":"Bloom","x":"https://okami.fandom.com/wiki/Bloom"},", which revives plant life by drawing a circle around a dying one, generating Praise that is used to upgrade aspects of the character like max health and amount of ink pot used for the techniques. This is referenced in Il Molise where Celestial Dusting heals the plants and still generating experience."]}]}}]}},{"c":["This weapon is individually featured as part of the ",{"i":"Sprite-O'Sole_Meeo.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," ",{"t":"O'Sole Meeo","r":"character:o-sole-meeo"}," ",{"t":"pin set","x":"https://www.fangamer.com/collections/vampire-survivors/products/osole-meeo-vampire-survivors-pin"},"."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This is one of the three weapons where that is the case, with the two others being the ",{"i":"Sprite-Gatti_Amari.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:gatti-amari"}," ",{"t":"Gatti Amari","r":"weapon:gatti-amari"}," and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Cross.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cross"}," ",{"t":"Cross","r":"weapon:cross"},"."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]}]}